{"uid":"7d618b5657ceff61","name":"test_there_is_exactly_one_function_that_produces_a_variant_table","fullName":"tests.test_transitions#test_there_is_exactly_one_function_that_produces_a_variant_table","historyId":"43e4b98467c704ba310dd4cd3310a3a1","time":{"start":1791921449301,"stop":1791921449317,"duration":16},"description":"`table_for` is the only producer of a variant of the STEP-state\n    table (`TABLE`/`VIGILANT_DELTA`) -- guards against a second,\n    hand-written non-vigilant table creeping in later.\n\n    Task 019 (requirement F) adds a SECOND declared table --\n    `TASK_STATUS_TABLE`/`TASK_STATUS_VIGILANT_DELTA`, a different concern\n    (one task's `status` field, not the run's own FSM position) -- with\n    its own analogous producer, `task_status_table_for`. The invariant this\n    test guards is now \"exactly one producer PER declared table\", not\n    \"exactly one producer in the whole module\": it still fails if either\n    table grows a second, duplicate producer.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p><code>table_for</code> is the only producer of a variant of the STEP-state<br />\ntable (<code>TABLE</code>/<code>VIGILANT_DELTA</code>) -- guards against a second,<br />\nhand-written non-vigilant table creeping in later.</p>\n<pre><code>Task 019 (requirement F) adds a SECOND declared table --\n`TASK_STATUS_TABLE`/`TASK_STATUS_VIGILANT_DELTA`, a different concern\n(one task's `status` field, not the run's own FSM position) -- with\nits own analogous producer, `task_status_table_for`. The invariant this\ntest guards is now &quot;exactly one producer PER declared table&quot;, not\n&quot;exactly one producer in the whole module&quot;: it still fails if either\ntable grows a second, duplicate producer.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791921449297,"stop":1791921449297,"duration":0},"status":"